{"strongs": "H5137", "word": "נָזָה", "translit": "na.zah", "root": "נור", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "spurt, spatter", "definition": "I. [ נָזָה ] verb spurt, spatter ; Hiph`il sprinkle (Late Hebrew Hiph`il sprinkle ; Aramaic נְדָא , אַדֵּי Lev 4:6 and often, for הִזָּה Syriac is erupit, stillavit Isa 63:3 , also prominutt , etc. PS 2291 ); — Qal Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִזֶּה Lev 6:20 (twice in verse), וְיֵז Isa 63:3 (but read וַיֵּז Che Di Du Ges «GKC:53»§ 53 , p. N., 107 bN. and others), וַיִּז 2Kgs 9:33 — spurt, spatter , always of blood: — וַיִּז מִדָּמָהּ אֶלֿ 2Kgs 9:33 and some of her blood spurted against the wall; so ויז נִצְחָם Isa 63:3 (with — עַלֿ of thing, in metaphor); יִזֶּה מִדָּמָה Lev 6:20 , compare v. Lev 6:20 (both with עַלֿ of thing). Hiph`il Perfect 3 masculine singular וְהִזָּת consecutive Lev 4:6 + 12 t.; 2 masculine singular וְהִזֵּיתָ֫ Exod 29:21 Imperfect יַזֶּה Lev 16:14 ( Isa 52:15 see below); וַיַּז Lev 8:11 ; Lev 8:30 Imperative הַזֵּה Num 8:7 Participle construct מַזֵּה Num 19:21 — cause to spurt, sprinkle upon, in ceremonials of P : with accusative + עַלֿ person Num 8:7 (water), + עַלֿ of thing, לִפְנֵי Lev 16:15 object often מִן partitive, or implied in context; followed by עַלֿ Lev 5:9 ; Lev 14:7 ; Lev 16:14 ; Lev 16:19 (all of blood); Lev 8:11 (oil); Num 19:18 ; Num 19:19 (water), Exod 29:21 ; Lev 8:30 (both blood and oil); followed by אֶלֿ Lev 14:51 (blood and water), אֶלנֹֿכַח פְּנֵי Num 19:4 (blood); followed by לִפְנֵי Lev 4:6 ; Lev 4:17 ; Lev 16:14 (blood), Lev 14:16 ; Lev 14:27 (oil); once without preposition מַזֵּה Num 19:21 the sprinkler of the water. — Isa 52:15 see II. נזה .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5094')\">BDB5094</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5137')\">H5137</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5093')\">BDB5093</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5095')\">BDB5095</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>נָזָה</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>spurt, spatter</highlightword>; <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlightword>sprinkle</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>sprinkle</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>נְדָא</bdbarc>, <bdbheb>אַדֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 4:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,6)\">Lev 4:6</ref> and often, for <bdbheb>הִזָּה</bdbheb> Syriac <placeholder3254/> is <highlight>erupit, stillavit</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 63:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,3)\">Isa 63:3</ref>, also<highlight>prominutt</highlight>, etc. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('PS')\">PS<sup>2291</sup></lookup>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>יִזֶּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,20)\">Lev 6:20</ref> (twice in verse), <bdbheb>וְיֵז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 63:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,3)\">Isa 63:3</ref> (but read <bdbheb>וַיֵּז</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:53»§ 53</sup>, p. N., 107 bN. and others), <bdbheb>וַיִּז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,33)\">2Kgs 9:33</ref> — <highlight>spurt, spatter</highlight>, always of blood: — <bdbheb>וַיִּז מִדָּמָהּ אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:33\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,33)\">2Kgs 9:33</ref> <highlight>and some of her blood spurted against</highlight> the wall; so <bdbheb>ויז נִצְחָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 63:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,3)\">Isa 63:3</ref> (with — <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> of thing, in metaphor); <bdbheb>יִזֶּה מִדָּמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 6:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,20)\">Lev 6:20</ref>, compare v.<ref ref=\"Lev 6:20\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,20)\">Lev 6:20</ref> (both with <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> of thing). <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וְהִזָּת</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Lev 4:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,6)\">Lev 4:6</ref> + 12 t.; 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>וְהִזֵּיתָ֫</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 29:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,21)\">Exod 29:21</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַזֶּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,14)\">Lev 16:14</ref> (<ref ref=\"Isa 52:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,15)\">Isa 52:15</ref> see below); <bdbheb>וַיַּז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 8:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,11)\">Lev 8:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:30\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,30)\">Lev 8:30</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הַזֵּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 8:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,7)\">Num 8:7</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> construct <bdbheb>מַזֵּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 19:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,21)\">Num 19:21</ref> — <highlight>cause to spurt, sprinkle</highlight> upon, in ceremonials of <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>: with accusative + <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Num 8:7\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(4,8,7)\">Num 8:7</ref> (water), + <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> of thing, <bdbheb>לִפְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,15)\">Lev 16:15</ref> object often <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> partitive, or implied in context; followed by <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 5:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,5,9)\">Lev 5:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:7\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,7)\">Lev 14:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,14)\">Lev 16:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:19\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,19)\">Lev 16:19</ref> (all of blood); <ref ref=\"Lev 8:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,11)\">Lev 8:11</ref> (oil); <ref ref=\"Num 19:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,18)\">Num 19:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 19:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,19)\">Num 19:19</ref> (water), <ref ref=\"Exod 29:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,29,21)\">Exod 29:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:30\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,30)\">Lev 8:30</ref> (both blood and oil); followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 14:51\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"51\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"51\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,51)\">Lev 14:51</ref> (blood and water), <bdbheb>אֶלנֹֿכַח פְּנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 19:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,4)\">Num 19:4</ref> (blood); followed by<bdbheb>לִפְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 4:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,6)\">Lev 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,17)\">Lev 4:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 16:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,14)\">Lev 16:14</ref> (blood), <ref ref=\"Lev 14:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,16)\">Lev 14:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 14:27\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(3,14,27)\">Lev 14:27</ref> (oil); once without preposition <bdbheb>מַזֵּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 19:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,19,21)\">Num 19:21</ref> <highlight>the sprinkler of</highlight> the water. — <ref ref=\"Isa 52:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"52\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"52\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,52,15)\">Isa 52:15</ref> see II.<bdbheb>נזה</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Lev 4:6", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 4, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Isa 63:3", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 63, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Lev 6:20", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 6, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "2Kgs 9:33", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 9, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Exod 29:21", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 29, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Lev 16:14", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 16, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Isa 52:15", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 52, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Lev 8:11", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 8, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Lev 8:30", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 8, "verse": 30}, {"raw": "Num 8:7", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 8, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Num 19:21", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 19, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Lev 16:15", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 16, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Lev 5:9", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 5, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Lev 14:7", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 14, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Lev 16:19", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 16, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Num 19:18", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 19, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Num 19:19", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 19, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Lev 14:51", "book": "LEV", "chapter": 14, "verse": 51}, {"raw": "Num 19:4", "book": "NUM", "chapter